WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.990
That looks fun, Anna, but I don't think circus performers are artists.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.090
I think they're athletes with interesting skills and costumes.

3
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.770
Hmm, that is a very interesting point of view, Pete.

4
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.190
And I completely disagree.

5
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.190
Anna, Michelangelo was an artist.

6
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.850
Rembrandt was an artist.

7
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.630
People who swing from ropes are not artists.

8
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:31.430
I know it's not easy to swing from a bar and catch someone by the hands.

9
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.430
You have to be very athletic to do that.

10
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:35.710
That's a good point, Pete.

11
00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:41.530
They are athletic, but they are called trapeze artists.

12
00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:44.170
Trapeze artists.

13
00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.610
I hear what you're saying, Anna.

14
00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:47.150
I do.

15
00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.850
But where is the art?

16
00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:51.190
Look at these guys.

17
00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:53.050
They're jugglers.

18
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.470
Yes, they are skilled in the art of juggling.

19
00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.690
They have a special skill, but are they artists?

20
00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:01.550
No.

21
00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:04.570
They're just throwing things back and forth.

22
00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:08.630
Kind of like you and me, Pete, we're going back and forth on this issue.

23
00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.810
I don't think we'll ever agree on this one.

24
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:18.090
No, but we can agree that these young people are amazing.

25
00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.870
Okay, yeah.

26
00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.790
We can agree on that.

27
00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:27.330
But still, they are very athletic, flipping and throwing each other around.

28
00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:30.110
Yes, I agree with you on that point.

29
00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.510
They did it.

30
00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:32.310
They agree.

31
00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:36.350
Anna says she agrees that the performers are athletic.

32
00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.330
That's a good point, Pete.

33
00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.310
They are athletic.

34
00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.510
I agree with you on that point.

35
00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.510
Now look for other ways they agree.
